          "id": "lauds-b0004",
          "verification": "pending"
        },
        {
          "type": "prayer",
          "source": "Primo rebelles Angelos, apostatas superbos, victor tremendo praelio ad tartarum trusisti.",
          "english": null,
          "sourcePages": [
            416
          ],
          "translation": null,
          "alignment": "single-language",
          "id": "lauds-b0005",
          "verification": "pending"
        },
        {
          "type": "rubric",
          "source": "Antiphona Apoc. 12",
          "english": null,
          "sourcePages": [
            416
          ],
          "translation": null,
          "alignment": "single-language",
          "id": "lauds-b0006",
          "verification": "pending"
        },
        {
          "type": "prayer",
          "source": "Factum est praelium magnum in coelo, Michael et Angeli ejus praeliabantur cum dracone; et draco pugnabat, et angeli ejus, et non valuerunt, neque locus inventus est eorum amplius in coelo. Et projectus est draco ille magnus, serpens antiquus, qui dicitur diabolus et satanas.",
          "english": null,
          "sourcePages": [
            416
          ],
          "translation": null,
          "alignment": "single-language",
          "id": "lauds-b0007",
          "verification": "pending"
        },
        {
          "type": "prayer",
          "source": "℣. Sub umbra alarum tuarum sancte Michael protege me.",
          "english": null,
          "sourcePages": [
            416
          ],
          "translation": null,
          "alignment": "single-language",
          "id": "lauds-b0008",
          "verification": "pending"
        },
        {
          "type": "prayer",
          "source": "℟. A facie inimicorum meorum.",
          "english": null,
          "sourcePages": [
            416
          ],
          "translation": null,
          "alignment": "single-language",
          "id": "lauds-b0009",
          "verification": "pending"
        },
        {
          "type": "prayer",
          "source": "Oremus,",
          "english": null,
          "sourcePages": [
            416
          ],
          "translation": null,
          "alignment": "single-language",
          "id": "lauds-b0010",
          "verification": "pending"
        },
        {
          "type": "prayer",
          "source": "Deus qui per gloriosum Archangelum tuum Michaelem, apostatam ac superbum luciferum, cum Angelis suis de coelo dejecisti; mitte quaeso in adjutorium meum, eundem Angelum, ut me adversus diabolicos insultus in vita et in morte mea protegat, et ad vitam aeternam perducat. Amen.",
          "english": null,
          "sourcePages": [
            416
          ],
          "translation": null,
          "alignment": "single-language",
          "id": "lauds-b0011",
          "verification": "pending"
        }
      ]
    },
